<h1>Your story has been shared with the funder</h1>

<div style="margin-top: 36px; text-align: left;">
  <p>
    Hello <strong><%= @recipient_name %></strong>,
  </p>

  <p>
    Your story has been shared with the funder who supported your training. As you requested, it is shared only with the funder and won't appear on Story Share.
  </p>

  <p>
    Thank you for sharing your story with us and helping others see the healing power of art!
  </p>

  <div style="text-align: center; background-color: #f3f4f6; border-radius: 6px; padding: 24px; margin: 16px 0;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; color: #166534; margin: 0; font-family: Lato, sans-serif;">
      <%= @story.title %>
    </h2>
  </div>
</div>

<p>
  <%= link_to "View your story",
              story_url(@story),
              style: "display:inline-block;
                      padding:10px 16px;
                      background:#2563eb;
                      color:#ffffff;
                      text-decoration:none;
                      border-radius:6px;
                      font-weight:bold;" %>
</p>
